Always enforce the use of the <x-info> component for all labels and table headers in new modules, pulling descriptions from config/hints.php.

For every new or edited Blade screen: **never** use native HTML `<select>` for dropdowns—always use `<x-searchable-select>` (or `<x-custom-select>` which wraps it), matching `resources/views/components/searchable-select.blade.php` (scrollable panel `max-h-[min(18rem,50vh)]`, optional inner search). Inside Bootstrap/modals use `:in-modal="true"`; for short fixed lists use `:searchable="false"`; preserve empty options via `empty-label` / `empty-option`. Do not revert CRM or other modules to plain `<select>` for styling convenience.
